<details><summary><strong>Verified email browser responses</strong></summary>
<p>Send a browser enrollment email to verify a saved address and let that person manage browser notifications. An incident verification email separately opens only that person’s response form for one open incident. Both links expire and work once. Incident participants must be registered before the incident opens; later identity changes cannot answer an older roster snapshot. Received, safe and needs help remain human responses, separate from delivery receipts.</p>
